========================================================================
MÖBIUS INCLUSION-EXCLUSION (the A+B+C-D-E-F+G structure)
========================================================================
codim-c sub-tournament count C(n-1,c), sign (-1)^(c+1):
  n=4: +3*sz3 -3*sz2 +1*sz1   (alt-sum of counts = 1; sum |counts| = 7 = 2^(n-1)-1)
  n=5: +4*sz4 -6*sz3 +4*sz2 -1*sz1   (alt-sum of counts = 1; sum |counts| = 15 = 2^(n-1)-1)
  n=6: +5*sz5 -10*sz4 +10*sz3 -5*sz2 +1*sz1   (alt-sum of counts = 1; sum |counts| = 31 = 2^(n-1)-1)
  n=7: +6*sz6 -15*sz5 +20*sz4 -15*sz3 +6*sz2 -1*sz1   (alt-sum of counts = 1; sum |counts| = 63 = 2^(n-1)-1)
  Note: Σ_c C(n-1,c) = 2^(n-1)-1 (all nonempty subsets of the n-1 non-anchor vertices);
  Σ_c (-1)^(c+1) C(n-1,c) = 1 - (1-1)^(n-1) = 1 (the Möbius/inclusion-exclusion sieve).

DONE.
